	(gr_text "AREA 2:\n50 OHM\nGPS FEED\nF.Cu W 0.171\nGAP 0.508"
		(at 191.6 121.5 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "d2445d61-5b18-45db-afb5-437a6c323dc2")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "1. 120.0 x 77.0 mm, R2.5 corners, 10 layers, 1.62 mm +/-10 % finished.\n2. JLCPCB standard stack JLC101611-2313 (2313 prepreg 0.089 / 2x 0.178, 0.15 cores), FR-4 Tg150+,\n   copper 1 oz outer / 1 oz inner finished. ENIG. Mask both sides, colour per order,\n   expansion 0.05, min web 0.10. Silk both sides white, clipping on pads acceptable.\n3. Through vias only: 0.15 mm hole / 0.25 pad on the USB pairs and tight fan-outs,\n   0.20-0.40 mm elsewhere. All vias epoxy filled (plugged) and copper capped,\n   both sides, including vias in SMD pads. No blind, buried or laser vias. No back-drill.\n4. Minimum trace 0.09 inner / 0.127 outer, spacing 0.127, hole-to-hole 0.20, annular\n   ring 0.05 (0.15 mm holes) / 0.075, copper to edge 0.30 (SMA J18 pads 0.22 by design).\n5. Controlled impedance inside dashed AREA 1 / AREA 2, +/-10 %: AREA 1 90 ohm diff,\n   F.Cu/B.Cu W 0.135 S 0.203 (ref In1/In8), In2 W 0.131 S 0.203 (ref In1+In3);\n   AREA 2 50 ohm coplanar GPS feed F.Cu W 0.133, 0.508 to GND pour (ref In1).\n   Adjust widths/gaps inside the areas only; keep dielectric spacing. Coupon and report\n   required.\n6. Outline routed; tab-route / mouse-bite panel only - NO V-SCORE (connector copper at\n   0.185-0.22 mm from top and bottom edges). Edge +/-0.10. Connectors overhang edges.\n7. Fiducials FID1-3 top, FID4-6 bottom: 1.0 Cu / 3.0 mask. 100 % e-test, IPC-A-600 cl 2."
		(at 209.92 28.33 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "4e652109-91ef-4bcb-b7f5-126e4332f160")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "F.Cu   Cu 0.035   signal / pairs\nD1     2313 0.089   er 4.05\nIn1    Cu 0.030  GND\nD2     core 0.15  er 4.6\nIn2    Cu 0.030  90R stripline, +12V\nD3     2313x2 0.178 er 4.05\nIn3    Cu 0.030  GND\nD4     core 0.15  er 4.6\nIn4    Cu 0.030  +3V3 / +12V\nD5     2313x2 0.178 er 4.05\nIn5    Cu 0.030  signal, +12V\nD6     core 0.15  er 4.6\nIn6    Cu 0.030  +5V / +12V\nD7     2313x2 0.178 er 4.05\nIn7    Cu 0.030  signal, VIN\nD8     core 0.15  er 4.6\nIn8    Cu 0.030  GND\nD9     2313 0.089   er 4.05\nB.Cu   Cu 0.035   signal / pairs\n1.62 nominal +/-10 % finished"
		(at 210.07 66.06 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "c053f7a9-e877-4eff-bfd1-361d53c1a057")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "A1 Double-sided SMT (~240 top / ~265 bottom) + THT: J11 PJ-080BH, J12-J17 PJ-063AH.\n   J1-J7 USB-C hybrid: SMT pads + PTH shell tabs (solder). J18 SMA edge-mount, solder\n   both sides. J8/J10 JST SH and J9 1.27 mm header SMT.\nA2 DNP: C161, H1-H4, R9, R13-R15, R51, R55-R57, R81, R90, R92-R94, R105, R167-R170, U47.\nA3 Polarity: LEDs D1-D7, D9-D14, D15; tantalum C50 C63 C76 C131 C144 C158 (+);\n   polymer C184 (- stripe); D8 TVS bidirectional; IC pin 1 per fab layer.\nA4 Fine pitch: RP2350A QFN-60 0.4, HD3SS3220 x7 WQFN 0.4, TUSB8044A x2 QFN-64 0.5,\n   TPD4E05U06 x21 USON 0.5, BMP581 LGA 0.5. Stencil 0.12 laser, apertures per paste\n   layer (U63-U68 PowerPAD 2.60 x 2.59). Filled vias in pads: no paste change.\nA5 Bake TUSB8044A, RP2350A, NEO-M9N per MSL. Lead-free profile. No-clean; DO NOT WASH\n   (U58 GPS, U49 SHT45, U50 VEML7700). No coating. ESD-sensitive. No programming.\nA6 Inspect QFN thermal pads by X-ray (voids < 25 %); AOI both sides."
		(at 210.25 96.78 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "92f6f65a-fbe8-4cfa-be3c-804e6c3de5f6")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "IMPEDANCE AREA 1: 90 OHM DIFF PAIRS ON F.Cu / In2.Cu / In5.Cu / B.Cu (SEE NOTE 5)"
		(at 88 66.8 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
